@startuml visit-material-page-flow
title Fluxo do módulo Visit Material Pages — API Orfanato NIB

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #37474F

actor "Admin\n(orfanatonib-app)" as Client
participant "VisitMaterialsPageController" as Controller
participant "parseVisitMaterialPayload\n(utils)" as Payload
participant "CreateVisitMaterialPageService" as CreateSvc
participant "UpdateVisitMaterialPageService" as UpdateSvc
participant "GetVisitMaterialPageService" as GetSvc
participant "DeleteVisitMaterialPageService" as DeleteSvc
participant "SetCurrentVisitMaterialPageService" as CurrentSvc
participant "VisitMaterialMediaService" as MediaSvc
participant "MediaItemProcessor\n(shared)" as Processor
participant "RouteService\n(infrastructure)" as RouteSvc
participant "AwsS3Service" as S3
database "VisitMaterialsPageRepository\n(TypeORM)" as Repo

== Entrada multipart ==
Client -> Controller : multipart/form-data\n(visitMaterialsPageData + arquivos)
activate Controller
Controller -> Controller : JwtAuthGuard (+ AdminRoleGuard na escrita)
Controller -> Payload : parseVisitMaterialPayload(raw, Dto)
note right of Payload
  O ValidationPipe global não enxerga
  o JSON dentro do campo multipart,
  então o parse e a validação ficam
  no controller. DTO inválido = 400.
end note
Payload --> Controller : DTO validado
Controller -> Controller : toFilesDict(files)

== POST /visit-material-pages ==
Controller -> CreateSvc : execute(dto, files)
activate CreateSvc
CreateSvc -> MediaSvc : toPolymorphicItems(acervos)
note right of MediaSvc
  Falha aqui (fieldKey ausente)
  acontece ANTES da transação.
end note
CreateSvc -> Repo : runInTransaction
activate Repo
CreateSvc -> Repo : create + save (página)
CreateSvc -> RouteSvc : generateAvailablePath + createRouteWithManager
CreateSvc -> Repo : save (página com rota)
CreateSvc -> Processor : processMediaItemsPolymorphic
Processor -> S3 : upload dos arquivos
deactivate Repo
CreateSvc --> Controller : VisitMaterialsPageResponseDTO
deactivate CreateSvc

== PATCH /visit-material-pages/:id ==
Controller -> UpdateSvc : execute(id, dto, files)
activate UpdateSvc
UpdateSvc -> GetSvc : findEntityOrFail(id)
UpdateSvc -> RouteSvc : findRouteByEntityId(id)
alt página ou rota inexistente
  UpdateSvc --> Controller : ResourceNotFoundException (404)
end
UpdateSvc -> MediaSvc : findGroupedByPage(id)
note right of MediaSvc
  Uma consulta só, agrupada por tipo,
  no lugar de quatro consultas iguais.
end note
loop para cada acervo (vídeo, documento, imagem, áudio)
  UpdateSvc -> MediaSvc : removeMissing(armazenados, recebidos)
  MediaSvc -> S3 : delete dos removidos
end
loop para cada item recebido
  alt item tem id
    UpdateSvc -> MediaSvc : upsert(item, tipo)
  else item novo
    UpdateSvc -> MediaSvc : add(item, tipo)
  end
end
UpdateSvc -> RouteSvc : upsertRoute (preserva public/current)
UpdateSvc -> Repo : runInTransaction → save (página)
UpdateSvc --> Controller : VisitMaterialsPageResponseDTO
deactivate UpdateSvc

== GET /visit-material-pages e /:id ==
Controller -> GetSvc : findAll(query) / findOne(id)
GetSvc -> Repo : findAll(filtros) / findById(id)
GetSvc -> Processor : findManyMediaItemsByTargets (uma consulta)
GetSvc --> Controller : DTO(s) com os quatro acervos

== GET /visit-material-pages/current-material ==
Controller -> GetSvc : findCurrentWeek()
GetSvc -> Repo : findCurrentWeek()
alt nenhuma página marcada
  GetSvc --> Controller : null (200)
else
  GetSvc --> Controller : VisitMaterialsPageResponseDTO
end

== POST /visit-material-pages/current-material/:id ==
Controller -> CurrentSvc : execute(id)
activate CurrentSvc
CurrentSvc -> GetSvc : findEntityOrFail(id)
CurrentSvc -> Repo : findCurrentWeek()
CurrentSvc -> Repo : runInTransaction\n(despromove a anterior + promove a nova)
CurrentSvc --> Controller : VisitMaterialsPageResponseDTO
deactivate CurrentSvc

== DELETE /visit-material-pages/:id ==
Controller -> DeleteSvc : execute(id)
activate DeleteSvc
DeleteSvc -> GetSvc : findEntityOrFail(id)
note right of DeleteSvc
  Resolvido fora do try: página
  inexistente continua 404, não
  vira falha genérica.
end note
DeleteSvc -> MediaSvc : findAllByPage(id)
DeleteSvc -> Processor : deleteMediaItems
Processor -> S3 : delete dos arquivos locais
DeleteSvc -> Repo : runInTransaction\n(remove rota + remove página)
DeleteSvc --> Controller : void
deactivate DeleteSvc

Controller --> Client : resposta / envelope de erro padrão
deactivate Controller

note over CreateSvc, DeleteSvc
  Falha de infraestrutura vira ProcessException (500).
  Exceções de aplicação (404, 400) sobem preservadas.
end note

@enduml
